@startuml
!pragma charset UTF-8
title UC-Google Reviews — Customer Link/QR and Conditional Manual Import
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #FCF9F8
  BorderColor #807663
  ArrowColor #5B5E67
}

start
|Guest or Member|
:Open Google review link or QR on the website;
:Choose whether to write a review directly on Google;
note right
The system does not create or submit a Google review for the customer.
end note

|Owner / Manager|
:Request manual one-way review import;
|System|
:Check prerequisites:\nverified Business Profile, authorised OAuth/API access,\nand approved retention/attribution/approval/appeal policy;
if (All prerequisites satisfied?) then (yes)
  :Start manual import;
  |Google Business Profile|
  :Return permitted review data;
  |System|
  :Store/display imported review according to approved policy;
  :Make visibility available to Owner and, if approved, public website;
else (no)
  :Block import and show missing governance/access prerequisite;
endif

note right
Import is one-way and manual. Reviews are never automatically attributed to Staff or used to calculate payroll/bonus.
end note
stop
@enduml
